cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If olomol helped with a publication, a thesis or teaching materials, please
  cite it with the version you used.
type: software
title: "olomol: drawing chemical structures, reactions and mechanisms"
abstract: >-
  olomol is a free program for drawing chemical structures, reactions and
  curved-arrow mechanisms, made for chemistry education. It runs entirely in
  the web browser, with nothing to install and no account, in Czech, English
  and German. RDKit checks every redrawing, flip and 3D view, so the molecule
  never changes behind the user's back.
